        },
        "7576": {
          "synopsis": "PT3 module \"xray speculation\" by Gasman (mixTS by Voxel_3umf).\nThe AY 1 half of a TurboSound pair; the other chip plays its own\narrangement of the same tune from the neighbouring bank.\n6735 bytes ($1A4F), $9D98-$B7E6. Header text is 99 bytes,\nthen TonTableId/Delay/Positions/Loop, the pointer table, the position\nlist and the pattern, sample and ornament data."
        },
        "7679": {
          "synopsis": "Pointer table: PatternsPointer, then 32 sample and 16 ornament\npointers. 49 words, each an offset from the module's first byte."
        },
        "0": {
          "synopsis": "VTII PT3 Player (Vortex Tracker II).\n$8000 holds LD HL with the default module address, so the three-byte\nentry points follow at $8003 (init, HL = module) and $8005 (play once\nper frame). MusicInit and MusicPlay in bank 5 call those."
        },
